{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22199","headline":"官舍内新凿小池 · 白居易","name":"官舍内新凿小池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘下开小池，盈盈水方积。\n中底铺白沙，四隅甃青石。\n勿言不深广，但取幽人适。\n泛灩微雨朝，泓澄明月夕。\n岂无大江水，波浪连天白。\n未如牀席间，方丈深盈尺。\n清浅可狎弄，昏烦聊漱涤。\n最爱晓暝时，一片秋天碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}